# iio-sensor-proxy with libssc: accelerometer mount matrix. The panel scans out
# landscape-native (2800x1752), so landscape with the camera edge up is "normal".
# Measured 2026-09-22: raw +X = camera edge up, raw +Y = camera edge right, +Z = screen up.
SUBSYSTEM=="misc", KERNEL=="fastrpc-*", ENV{ACCEL_MOUNT_MATRIX}+="0, 1, 0; -1, 0, 0; 0, 0, 1"
